    "type": "post",
    "title": "Divided Soul - Valley of Legends",
    "text": "A new painting I've been working on for the Divided Soul project. Spent countless hours on this one, so I'm pretty happy to call it finished    Previous versions and work in progress pictures are on my IG page, don't forget to check 'em!  \n\nABOUT THE DIVIDED SOUL PROJECT\n\nIt is a personal fantasy project about a surreal world with spectacular landscapes and environments.\n\nI came up with the idea of this project in the summer of 2015, and I've been working on it on and off continuously since then. I realized that this is a great opportunity to try different painting techniques and expand my visual library, so the main purpose of the project is learning. However, as the project grows I'm thinking about expanding the borders of this series by adding a story behind the paintings, and I hope that one day I can make an artbook of the project.\n\nFor work in progress stages of my paintings, follow my Instagram page\n\nI'm thankful for all the support I get from you!  \n\nThe complete Divided Soul collection:\n\n        \n            \n                \n\n                Mature Content",
